            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$worker",
              "kind": "colleague",
              "trust": 0.1,
              "reason": "危急时相助"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "vienna-illness-household.wage-earner-injury.take-to-hospital.alt1",
              "key": "take-to-hospital",
              "text": "{worker}的指头被冲床压住，{subject}扶着一路走到医院。{employer}派人送来两克朗，指头保住了，却弯不回去；{worker}盯着自己的手，半天没说一句话。",
              "tone": ["clinical"]
